+section('organizations pt-0')
    .row 
        .col-12.col-lg-5
            .sticky-side.position-sticky 
                +title('mb-4 pt-4','A Workplace Built for People', 'QFC is governed by three independent organisations that work together to promote transparency, compliance and business confidence. Each institution plays a critical role in creating a global business centre and environment.')
        .col-12.col-lg-7
            .card(class="card-journey work-card mb-4")
                .card-body
                    figure.mb-0 
                        img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/icons/Collaborative Spirit.png")  
                    .details
                        a.card-title.fw-medium.mb-3(href="#") Collaborative Spirit
                        p.card-text.fw-norml.fs-20 At QFC, we believe that working together leads to greater success. Our open and inclusive environment encourages teams to share ideas and solve challenges collectively.
            .card(class="card-journey work-card mb-4")
                .card-body
                    figure.mb-0 
                        img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/icons/Diversity & Inclusion.png")  
                    .details
                        a.card-title.fw-medium.mb-3(href="#") Diversity & Inclusion
                        p.card-text.fw-norml.fs-20 Our community is enriched by people from different cultures and backgrounds. We foster respect and inclusion, ensuring everyone’s voice is heard and valued.
            .card(class="card-journey work-card mb-4")
                .card-body
                    figure.mb-0 
                        img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/icons/Innovation-Driven Mindset.png")  
                    .details
                        a.card-title.fw-medium.mb-3(href="#") Learning & Growth
                        p.card-text.fw-norml.fs-20 Continuous development is key. QFC offers training, mentorship, and access to global resources so individuals can sharpen their skills and advance their careers.
            .card(class="card-journey work-card mb-4")
                .card-body
                    figure.mb-0 
                        img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/icons/Learning & Growth.png")  
                    .details
                        a.card-title.fw-medium.mb-3(href="#") Wellbeing & Balance
                        p.card-text.fw-norml.fs-20 We care about the whole person. Wellness initiatives, flexible work arrangements, and support programs ensure a healthy balance between work and personal life.
            .card(class="card-journey work-card mb-4")
                .card-body
                    figure.mb-0 
                        img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/icons/Wellbeing & Balance.png")  
                    .details
                        a.card-title.fw-medium.mb-3(href="#") Innovation-Driven Mindset
                        p.card-text.fw-norml.fs-20 Creativity and experimentation are encouraged. We support forward-thinking approaches that inspire new solutions and help businesses stay ahead in a fast-changing world.
